      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## B2B Demo Lead Rescue Desk: Enrich, Score, Route, and SLA Escalate\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives B2B demo leads through a webhook, normalizes and scores them, and rejects submissions that lack usable contact information. Valid leads are enriched with submitted page context, written to a Google Sheets audit log, routed by priority, and emailed to the appropriate sales or review queue. Hot leads can trigger an additional executive escalation before the workflow returns a success response to the original webhook caller.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Lead Intake Webhook URL in the form, landing page, or lead capture system that submits demo requests.\n- Add Google Sheets credentials and select the spreadsheet/tab used by the Append Lead Audit Row node.\n- Add Gmail credentials for the hot lead, review queue, normal lead, and executive escalation email nodes.\n- Review the custom code in the normalization/scoring and page-signal extraction nodes to ensure field names, scoring rules, owner assignment, and SLA values match your lead data.\n- Confirm email recipients, subjects, and response payload fields are appropriate for your sales process.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the scoring thresholds, priority routing rules, SLA minutes, email templates, executive escalation criteria, and audit sheet columns to match your go-to-market process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
